    "summary": "Video editor",
    "description": "Kdenlive is a video editing application with support for many audio and video formats. It offers\n      advanced editing features, a variety of effects and transitions, color correction, audio post-production\n      and subtitling tools. Additionally, it provides the flexibility to render into practically any\n      format of your choice.\nFeatures:\nNested Sequences\nConfigurable interface and shortcuts\nScopes: Histogram, Vectorscope, RGB Parade, Waveform and Audio Meter\nProxy editing\nFree online assets and templates\nMotion tracking\nAI powered tools",
